  "summary": "作者解释武贪先贫后富等古赋，强调丑未命格须多吉且行限佳，是否先贫还要看行业；阴金克阳木在会吉下可成有情制化。武贪也涵盖辰戌分坐而命身分居两宫的情形。三十只是中年发达的概数，须结合社会环境与寿命，不能当固定年龄或必然早年凶断。",
  "summary_en": "The author qualifies verses about Wu Qu–Tan Lang becoming wealthy after hardship. Chou–Wei configurations require benefics and favorable cycles; prior poverty is not inevitable and occupation matters. Yin Metal overcoming Yang Wood can become a constructive restraint with benefic support. The discussion also includes Wu Qu and Tan Lang split between Chen and Xu with Life and Body split between those locations. Thirty is an approximate midlife marker, not a fixed onset age or proof of inevitable early misfortune; social conditions and life expectancy matter.",
